5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to pick a destination before bookings open. What are the main factors we should consider first?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,The previous camp’s sleep deprivation ruined our final sessions. I need to verify the actual sleeping conditions before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I’m worried about the workload. Last year, the organizers were exhausted from all the planning and duties.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to understand where the money actually went last year before we agree on any new costs.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,The last camp failed to break down the barriers between year groups. I need to know how the location affects who actually spends time together.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, @Minato, @Misaki, @Takumi, please each pick two items from the list to investigate.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Minato"",""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,I’ll check the accounts from two clubs that went inland and the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I’ll look into the canteen closure and last year’s cooking duty, and the group transport in three years of receipts.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I’ll check the group transport in three years of receipts and the quoting terms for whole-building lets.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I’ll check what the seniors say about year-groups mixing and the attendance sheets for the away camps.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I’ll investigate the membership list against first-train times and the vacation timetable for the club's own hall.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I’ll also look into the lottery and application for public group bookings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
