35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,- **Shion**: The inland accounts show eight to a room with lights out at eleven. That explains the poor performance.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: The canteen closes, so cooking took two hours daily. Transport was also the biggest cost.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,-Misaki: Transport was 38% of costs when we went far. Whole-building deposits are non-refundable if people drop out late.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The seniors say mixing only happens in shared evenings. Attendance sheets show a fifth never came at all.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Takumi"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Takumi: The seniors say mixing only happens in shared evenings. Attendance sheets show a fifth never came at all.""}]}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,- **Asuka**: A third can't reach campus by nine without a bed. Our own hall is already booked by three other clubs.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"- **Shion**: @Asuka, that confirms it. We need a location with proper dorms and enforced rest, not just a hall.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: @Misaki, if the deposit is non-refundable, how do we protect the budget if someone cancels?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, that’s the risk. We’d have to cover the gap from the club account, which is already strained.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, shared evenings are the only way we mix. We need a place where everyone stays together, not just trains.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, the hall is unusable. We need a destination that solves the transport and accommodation issues simultaneously.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, agreed. The inland option offers enforced rest, but the eight-to-a-room density is unacceptable. We need a balance.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, I’m worried. If we can’t cover the gap, the organizers will be stuck with the debt again.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, I understand. That is exactly why I need to see the full breakdown before we commit to any non-refundable terms.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, the attendance data is clear. If we don’t force shared living, we lose a fifth of the club. We must prioritize that.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, shared living is essential, but we must ensure the cost structure doesn't bankrupt us. I need a clear financial path forward.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, the rate sheet shows 1,100 yen per night with equipment included. That is the only option with a fixed, transparent cost structure.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, I’m glad we found the transport costs. If we pick a place with staff, we save time and money.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, exactly. Staffed kitchens remove the daily cooking burden, which directly reduces the hidden labor costs that drained us last year.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, the 1,100 yen rate is manageable, but only if we avoid the eight-to-a-room density. We need a place that guarantees proper rest and shared evenings.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
56,3,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
